WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.780
Quotes: build, version, send and track quotes.

2
00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:09.720
Click "New quote" or start "From a template…".

3
00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:16.060
Build lines with "Section" and "Line"; set the "Discount", "Payment plan" and "Terms".

4
00:00:16.614 --> 00:00:22.490
Click "Save & send"; the customer sees it in the chat and on their page, and accepts it.

5
00:00:23.035 --> 00:00:28.330
After changes, click "Send new version"; earlier versions are kept.

6
00:00:28.881 --> 00:00:35.070
Record a paper acceptance with "Accept (signed on paper)" so the project is created.
